NOTICE: third-party software (not included in this repository)

* devkitARM / devkitPro toolchain and libctru are needed to build. libctru is
  distributed under the zlib license; the built ocarina.3gx links a few of its
  system-call wrappers (svc*), so binary releases contain small parts of
  libctru (Copyright (C) the libctru contributors, zlib license).
* 3gxtool (https://gitlab.com/thepixellizeross/3gxtool, MIT license according
  to its package metadata) converts the ELF into the .3gx format. It is a
  build tool only and is not included.
* Luma3DS (GPL-3.0) provides the plugin loader that runs ocarina.3gx on the
  console. Nothing from Luma3DS is included; the 3GX header facts used here
  come from its public documentation and source.
* CTRPluginFramework is NOT used by this project (see docs/HISTORY.md).

"The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time 3D" and Nintendo 3DS are trademarks of
Nintendo. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Nintendo. No game
code, assets or data are distributed; src/sigs.h holds short masked
instruction patterns used only to locate functions in the user's own game at
run time.
